+- `tla-check`: reruns a TLA+ model with TLC and reads its counterexamples, when a check is a TLA+ model.
+- `create-formal-verification-skill`: writes the verify skill this one maintains, when none exists yet.
+- `trailofbits-property-based-testing`: tests the real code with generated inputs when no verifier runs on its language.
+- `coding-agent-find-implicit-models`: finds the state machines and other models the code implies but never names, as candidate targets.
